# Cloudflare Pages redirects (decision #7; replaces netlify.toml). Unknown paths outside the planner already fall back
# to the home page, because the site has no 404.html. The first rule that matches wins, and a 200 rule serves the file
# at its target without looking at these rules again.
# The planner (#18, design §3 and §11): /planner/ and everything under it open it, whose files live under /app/ (built
# into web/app/). Its page is /app/, not /app/index.html: Cloudflare drops a rule that proxies to a path ending in
# /index.html as an infinite loop.
# The addresses used while it was built, /planner/next/..., move to the same address under /planner/ (301), so old
# links and bookmarks still work. The old planner's address, /planner/old/, goes to /planner/ (301) since the clean-up
# (build pull request 14) removed it.
/planner/next     /planner/           301
/planner/next/*   /planner/:splat     301
/planner/old      /planner/           301
/planner/old/*    /planner/           301
/planner          /planner/           301
/planner/*        /app/               200
